    "sections": {
        "description": "<p><a href=\"https://demo.lokuswp.com/plugins/fundrizer\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo</a> | <a href=\"https://demo.lokuswp.com/plugins/fundrizer-elementor\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo Elementor</a></p>\n<p>8-Minute Build: Create a Donation Website for Free Without Purchasing Anything<br />\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tHuGG6G5Dwc?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>Fundrizer helps you build a Dontion Website and Fundraising Platform using WordPress&#8217;s latest technology.<br />\nLeveraging the Block-Based System, you can create beautiful donation pages with intuitive drag-and-drop functionality<br />\nwhile maintaining full control over your design and donor experience.</p>\n<h3>What Sets Fundrizer Apart</h3>\n<p><strong>🚀 FSE-First Fundraising Solution</strong> – Fundrizer is built from the ground up for WordPress Full Site Editing while maintaining compatibility with classic workflows.<br />\n<strong>🛒 Seamless WooCommerce Integration</strong><br />\n<strong>🎯 Conversion-Focused Design</strong><br />\n<strong>🛠️ Future-Proof Architecture</strong><br />\n<strong>⚡ Optimized Performance</strong></p>\n<h3>Currency Support</h3>\n<p>– USD<br />\n– IDR<br />\n– MYR<br />\n– SGD<br />\n– AUD</p>\n<p>Technical Compatibility That Works For You<br />\n&#8211; Full WordPress FSE Support – Take advantage of the latest WordPress features with block-based design flexibility<br />\n– Classic Shortcode Support – Convert Block Pattern into Shortcode<br />\n– WooCommerce Checkout Block Compatible – Provide a smooth, modern donation experience that converts<br />\n– Works With Popular Page Builders – Seamless integration with Elementor, Oxygen, and more</p>\n<p>⚡ Pro Version with More Features<br />\n<a href=\"https://demo.lokuswp.com/plugins/fundrizer-pro\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo Pro</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Recurring Donation </li>\n<li>On Page Donation </li>\n<li>Filter Campaign by Category</li>\n<li>Advance Analytics </li>\n<li>More Settings &amp; Control</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Quick Links 🔗</h3>\n<p>– <a href=\"https://fundrizer.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Fundrizer Website</a><br />\n– <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@lokuswp\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Documentation</a><br />\n– <a href=\"https://lokuswp.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Learn More about WordPress FSE</a></p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='where%20can%20i%20get%20help%20if%20this%20plugin%20has%20issues%3F'>\nWhere can I get help if this plugin has issues?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>For support with this plugin, please visit the <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/support/plugin/fundrizer/\" rel=\"ugc\">Support Forums</a>.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='privacy%20policy'>\nPrivacy Policy\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Fundrizer uses Appsero SDK to collect some telemetry data upon user&#8217;s confirmation. Integrating Appsero SDK <strong>DOES NOT IMMEDIATELY</strong> start gathering data, <strong>without confirmation from users in any case.</strong> Learn more about how <a href=\"https://appsero.com/privacy-policy/\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Appsero collects and uses this data</a>.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.4.2</h4>\n<p>– Refine Copywriting &amp; Thumbnail</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Collect donations for free with flexible design, multi-campaigns, seamless WooCommerce, and full site editing support",
    "description": "<p><a href=\"https://demo.lokuswp.com/plugins/fundrizer\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo</a> | <a href=\"https://demo.lokuswp.com/plugins/fundrizer-elementor\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo Elementor</a></p>\n<p>8-Minute Build: Create a Donation Website for Free Without Purchasing Anything<br />\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tHuGG6G5Dwc?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>Fundrizer helps you build a Dontion Website and Fundraising Platform using WordPress&#8217;s latest technology.<br />\nLeveraging the Block-Based System, you can create beautiful donation pages with intuitive drag-and-drop functionality<br />\nwhile maintaining full control over your design and donor experience.</p>\n<h3>What Sets Fundrizer Apart</h3>\n<p><strong>🚀 FSE-First Fundraising Solution</strong> – Fundrizer is built from the ground up for WordPress Full Site Editing while maintaining compatibility with classic workflows.<br />\n<strong>🛒 Seamless WooCommerce Integration</strong><br />\n<strong>🎯 Conversion-Focused Design</strong><br />\n<strong>🛠️ Future-Proof Architecture</strong><br />\n<strong>⚡ Optimized Performance</strong></p>\n<h3>Currency Support</h3>\n<p>– USD<br />\n– IDR<br />\n– MYR<br />\n– SGD<br />\n– AUD</p>\n<p>Technical Compatibility That Works For You<br />\n&#8211; Full WordPress FSE Support – Take advantage of the latest WordPress features with block-based design flexibility<br />\n– Classic Shortcode Support – Convert Block Pattern into Shortcode<br />\n– WooCommerce Checkout Block Compatible – Provide a smooth, modern donation experience that converts<br />\n– Works With Popular Page Builders – Seamless integration with Elementor, Oxygen, and more</p>\n<p>⚡ Pro Version with More Features<br />\n<a href=\"https://demo.lokuswp.com/plugins/fundrizer-pro\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Demo Pro</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Recurring Donation </li>\n<li>On Page Donation </li>\n<li>Filter Campaign by Category</li>\n<li>Advance Analytics </li>\n<li>More Settings &amp; Control</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Quick Links 🔗</h3>\n<p>– <a href=\"https://fundrizer.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Fundrizer Website</a><br />\n– <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@lokuswp\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Documentation</a><br />\n– <a href=\"https://lokuswp.com\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Learn More about WordPress FSE</a></p>\n",
